== Icons ==

Material icons, as published in @mui/icons-material 7.3.8 (https://github.com/mui/material-ui), 70 icons in
src/Fadenstack.UI.Avalonia/Themes/Icons.axaml, generated by tools/icons/build-icons.mjs. The package is not shipped: only
the path data of the listed icons is. The icons after them in the same file (Icon.Agent) are Fadenstack's own, drawn on
the same grid, and Apache-2.0 like the SDK; they are not Material icons.

